# 198 of the 247 sources under src/ were stored with CRLF and 49 with LF, and nothing in the
# repository declared an intent. That is a trap: whoever next opens one of those files with a
# different core.autocrlf rewrites every line of it, and the real one-line change disappears into
# a whole-file diff. Everything text is stored as LF from here on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated bundles and generated documentation. Not normalised, and not worth diffing: dist/ is
# gulp output and docs/ is an ESDoc dump.
dist/** -text -diff
docs/** -text -diff

# Lockfiles are generated too, and reviewing them line by line helps nobody.
yarn.lock -diff

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
